2Sa 11:1 , While Joab besieges Rabbah, David commits adultery with Bath-sheba;
2Sa 11:6 , Uriah, sent for by David to cover the adultery, would not go home;
2Sa 11:14 , He carries to Joab the letter of his death;
2Sa 11:18 , Joab sends the news thereof to David;
2Sa 11:26 , David takes Bath-sheba to wife.
